WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.838
Songs carry messages. Perform with steady rhythm, suitable stress and respectful

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:07.368
actions; then discuss the value shown.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.488
What helps a group sing the same song together? Answer: Keeping a steady beat

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:18.487
Sing a familiar Ghanaian community song. Tap the beat and explain its message to a

00:00:18.487 --> 00:00:18.828
partner.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.516
Discuss why: A shared beat keeps singers together.
